@startuml
title <size:24>Container View: Pipeline de datos del portafolio</size>\n<size:24>Nivel 2: servicios persistentes, tareas efímeras y Snowflake SaaS.</size>

set separator none
left to right direction
skinparam ranksep 20
skinparam nodesep 5
hide stereotype

<style>
